## 9. Testnet

Tower provides identical API endpoints across mainnet and testnet environments.

To switch environments, update the base URL in your requests:
- **Testnet Gateway (Railway)**: `https://www.tower.exchange/api/public`
- **Mainnet Gateway**: `https://www.tower.exchange/api/public`

You use the same API key on testnet as you do on mainnet. Testnet transactions execute on the Arc Testnet (`chainId: 5042002`) and do not cost real funds.

To obtain testnet tokens:
1. Visit the Tower Faucet at `https://tower.exchange/faucet`.
2. Connect your wallet or input your Arc address.
3. Request testnet USDC, EURC, and native gas tokens. Tokens credit to your address within seconds.
